INTERPRETATION
The reflection resolvent decomposes twice the endpoint current into
central-crossing components.  Individual crossing components and
individual post-crossing target columns can be negative.  Adjacent-column
pairing and payment of all negative columns solely from the innermost
column are also false.  In contrast, every cumulative target suffix,
ordered from the centre outwards, was nonnegative in the displayed exact
scans.  In the case command the complete sum is 884076032, exactly twice
the independently computed endpoint current 442038016.

